[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_01_0010","text":"那等回到事务所后──\n哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_01_0020","text":"──！\n狗狗！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_01_0030","text":"超级大只，超级毛茸茸的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_01_0000","text":"狗主人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_01_0040","text":"您喜欢狗吗？\n要摸摸看吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_01_0050","text":"可以吗！？\n──啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_01_0060","text":"那个，制作人\n我可以稍微摸一下吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_01_0070","text":"当然可以\n时间不用在意"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_01_0080","text":"……好的！谢谢您！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_01_0090","text":"（她是在意我和回事务所的时间吧\n　其实再多任性一点也没关系的）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03010900_01_0100","text":"可以摸摸吗……？\n──哇！　啊哈哈，被抓住了！"}]
